manageFlashLoan.t.sol
├── when call is reentrant
│  └── it should revert with ManageFlashLoanReentrantCall
└── when call is not reentrant
   ├── when caller is not the flash loan module
   │  └── it should revert with NotFlashLoanModule
   └── when caller is the flash loan module
      ├── when the call is not made from within a managePosition call
      │  └── it should revert with DirectManageFlashLoanCall
      └── when the call is made from within a managePosition call
         ├── when the instruction is not of the flash loan management type
         │  └── it should revert with InvalidInstructionType
         └── when the instruction is of the flash loan management type
            ├── when the instruction position ID or isDebt flag does not match the managed position
            │  └── it should revert with InstructionsMismatch
            └── when the instruction position ID and isDebt flag match the managed position
               ├── when the instruction isDebt flag is set
               │  └── it should revert with InvalidDebtFlag
               └── when the instruction isDebt flag is not set
                  ├── it should transfer the flash loan funds from the flash loan module to the module's safe
                  ├── when the instruction proof is not valid against the merkle root set in the module
                  │  └── it should revert with InvalidInstructionProof
                  └── when the instruction proof is valid against the merkle root set in the module
                     ├── it should execute the instruction
                     └── it should transfer the flash loan funds back from the module's safe to the flash loan module
